CLASS:PUBLIC
CREATED:20250227T234032Z
DESCRIPTION:\nFuture Data Driven Summit 2025\n\n*	Location: Online | Join H
	ere <https://bit.ly/fdd2025hub> \n*	Date & Time: September 24\, 2025\, at 
	09:00 AM Eastern Time (US & Canada).\n*	The meeting will open 30 minutes e
	arly for check-ins and networking.\n________________________________\n\nTh
	ank you for registering for the Future Data Driven Summit 2025! Your parti
	cipation makes this event special.\n\nAbout the Future Data Driven Summit\
	n\nAn annual joint event of data platforms user groups\, focuses on cuttin
	g-edge data platforms and AI technologies. This is our fifth edition\, bri
	nging together industry experts and enthusiasts worldwide.\n\nWhat to Expe
	ct\n\nLearn from data and AI experts\, network and meet your peers\, and j
	oin raffles for swags/gifts and fun activities.\nHow to Join\nKick-off in 
	the Hub virtual room on September 24\, 2025 at 9:00 AM Eastern Time (US & 
	Canada). The opening session will provide an overview of the day's schedul
	e and how to join sessions. The Hub room will remain open all day for info
	rmation\, support\, and networking. It will also host the after-party and 
	fun activities\, including swag giveaways. Check sessions schedule here <h
	ttps://datadrivencommunity.com/FutureDataDriven2025.html> .\nNeed Support?
	\nFor technical issues during the event\, use the QnA in the Hub room <htt
	ps://bit.ly/fdd2025hub> . For questions before the event\, contact Ronen A
	riely on Facebook <https://www.facebook.com/ronen.ariely>  or LinkedIn <ht
	tps://www.linkedin.com/in/pitoach/> .\n________________________________\n\
	nLet's make the most of this event together! 🎉\nThank you for registe
	ring! We look forward to seeing you on September 24th!\n \n
DTEND;TZID="Eastern Standard Time":20250924T200000
