	]--></head><body lang=en-IL link=blue vlink=purple style='tab-interval:36.
	0pt\;word-wrap:break-word'><div class=WordSection1><h1><b><span style='fon
	t-size:24.0pt\;font-family:"Times New Roman"\,serif\;color:black\;mso-font
	-kerning:18.0pt'>Future Data Driven Summit 2025<o:p></o:p></span></b></h1>
	<ul type=disc><li class=MsoNormal style='color:black\;mso-margin-top-alt:a
	uto\;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto\;mso-list:l1 level1 lfo3\;tab-stops:list 3
	6.0pt'><b><span style='font-size:13.5pt\;font-family:"Times New Roman"\,se
	rif\;mso-fareast-font-family:"Times New Roman"'>Location:</span></b><span 
	style='font-size:13.5pt\;font-family:"Times New Roman"\,serif\;mso-fareast
	-font-family:"Times New Roman"'>&nbsp\;Online |&nbsp\;<a href="https://bit
	.ly/fdd2025hub">Join Here</a><o:p></o:p></span></li><li class=MsoNormal st
	yle='color:black\;mso-margin-top-alt:auto\;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto\;mso
	-list:l1 level1 lfo3\;tab-stops:list 36.0pt'><b><span style='font-size:13.
	5pt\;font-family:"Times New Roman"\,serif\;mso-fareast-font-family:"Times 
	New Roman"'>Date &amp\; Time:</span></b><span style='font-size:13.5pt\;fon
	t-family:"Times New Roman"\,serif\;mso-fareast-font-family:"Times New Roma
	n"'>&nbsp\;September 24\, 2025\, at 09:00 AM Eastern Time (US &amp\; Canad
	a).<o:p></o:p></span></li><li class=MsoNormal style='color:black\;mso-marg
	in-top-alt:auto\;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto\;mso-list:l1 level1 lfo3\;tab-
	stops:list 36.0pt'><span style='font-size:13.5pt\;font-family:"Times New R
	oman"\,serif\;mso-fareast-font-family:"Times New Roman"'>The meeting will 
	open 30 minutes early for check-ins and networking.<o:p></o:p></span></li>
	</ul><div class=MsoNormal align=center style='text-align:center'><span sty
	le='mso-fareast-font-family:"Times New Roman"'><hr size=1 width="100%" nos
	hade style='color:black' align=center></span></div><p class=MsoNormal styl
	e='mso-margin-top-alt:auto\;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto'><span style='font-
	size:13.5pt\;font-family:"Times New Roman"\,serif\;mso-fareast-font-family
	:"Times New Roman"\;color:black'>Thank you for registering for the Future 
	Data Driven Summit 2025! Your participation makes this event special.<o:p>
	</o:p></span></p><h1>About the Future Data Driven Summit<o:p></o:p></h1><p
	 class=MsoNormal style='mso-margin-top-alt:auto\;mso-margin-bottom-alt:aut
	o'><span style='font-size:13.5pt\;font-family:"Times New Roman"\,serif\;ms
	o-fareast-font-family:"Times New Roman"\;color:black'>An annual joint even
	t of data platforms user groups\, focuses on cutting-edge data platforms a
	nd AI technologies. This is our fifth edition\, bringing together industry
	 experts and enthusiasts worldwide.<o:p></o:p></span></p><h1>What to Expec
	t<o:p></o:p></h1><p class=MsoNormal style='mso-margin-top-alt:auto\;mso-ma
	rgin-bottom-alt:auto'><span style='font-size:13.5pt\;font-family:"Times Ne
	w Roman"\,serif\;mso-fareast-font-family:"Times New Roman"\;color:black'>L
	earn from data and AI experts\, network and meet your peers\, and join raf
	fles for swags/gifts and fun activities.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=Mso
	Normal style='mso-margin-top-alt:auto\;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto\;mso-out
	line-level:3'><b><span style='font-size:13.5pt\;font-family:"Times New Rom
	an"\,serif\;mso-fareast-font-family:"Times New Roman"\;color:black'>How to
	 Join<o:p></o:p></span></b></p><p class=MsoNormal style='mso-margin-top-al
	t:auto\;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto'><span style='font-size:13.5pt\;font-fa
	mily:"Times New Roman"\,serif\;mso-fareast-font-family:"Times New Roman"\;
	color:black'>Kick-off in the Hub virtual room on September 24\, <span clas
	s=GramE>2025</span> at 9:00 AM Eastern Time (US &amp\; Canada). The openin
	g session will provide an overview of the day's schedule and how to join s
	essions. The Hub room will remain open all day for information\, support\,
	 and networking. It will also host the after-party and fun activities\, in
	cluding swag giveaways. Check sessions schedule&nbsp\;<a href="https://dat
	adrivencommunity.com/FutureDataDriven2025.html">here</a>.<o:p></o:p></span
	></p><p class=MsoNormal style='mso-margin-top-alt:auto\;mso-margin-bottom-
	alt:auto\;mso-outline-level:3'><b><span style='font-size:13.5pt\;font-fami
	ly:"Times New Roman"\,serif\;mso-fareast-font-family:"Times New Roman"\;co
	lor:black'>Need Support?<o:p></o:p></span></b></p><p class=MsoNormal style
	='mso-margin-top-alt:auto\;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto'><span style='font-s
	ize:13.5pt\;font-family:"Times New Roman"\,serif\;mso-fareast-font-family:
	"Times New Roman"\;color:black'>For technical issues during the event\, us
	e the <span class=SpellE>QnA</span> in the&nbsp\;<a href="https://bit.ly/f
	dd2025hub">Hub room</a>. For questions before the event\, contact Ronen Ar
	iely on&nbsp\;<a href="https://www.facebook.com/ronen.ariely">Facebook</a>
	&nbsp\;or&nbsp\;<a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/pitoach/">LinkedIn</a
	>.<o:p></o:p></span></p><div class=MsoNormal align=center style='text-alig
	n:center'><span style='mso-fareast-font-family:"Times New Roman"'><hr size
	=1 width="100%" noshade style='color:black' align=center></span></div><p c
	lass=MsoNormal style='mso-margin-top-alt:auto\;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto'
	><b><span style='font-size:13.5pt\;font-family:"Times New Roman"\,serif\;m
	so-fareast-font-family:"Times New Roman"\;color:black'>Let's make the most
	 of this event together! </span></b><b><span style='font-size:13.5pt\;font
	-family:"Segoe UI Emoji"\,sans-serif\;mso-fareast-font-family:"Times New R
	oman"\;mso-bidi-font-family:"Segoe UI Emoji"\;color:black'>&#127881\;</spa
	n></b><span style='font-size:13.5pt\;font-family:"Times New Roman"\,serif\
	;mso-fareast-font-family:"Times New Roman"\;color:black'><o:p></o:p></span
	></p><p class=MsoNormal style='mso-margin-top-alt:auto\;mso-margin-bottom-
	alt:auto'><span style='font-size:13.5pt\;font-family:"Times New Roman"\,se
	rif\;mso-fareast-font-family:"Times New Roman"\;color:black'>Thank you for
	 registering! We look forward to seeing you on September 24th!<o:p></o:p><
	/span></p><p><span style='font-size:16.0pt\;font-family:"David"\,sans-seri
	f'><o:p>&nbsp\;</o:p></span></p></div></body></html>
